(Bug #110: `Write "{...}" to <sink>` shares the exact same slot parser as
 `Print` - `resolve_format_variable` is documented in
 src/codegen/format.rs as "THE single name-resolution path shared by every
 format-string sink" - so a quoted one-word name in a `Write` format
 string was broken the same way, and is fixed the same way.)

a text called 'label' is "AB".
a text called 'path' is "/tmp/vox_test_628_write.txt".
open a file for writing called 'report' at 'path'.
Write "{'label'}" to 'report'.
close 'report'.

a buffer called 'readback' is 4 bytes in size.
open a file for reading called 'saved' at 'path'.
read from 'saved' into 'readback'.
close 'saved'.
Print 'readback'.
Delete the file 'path'.
